title: Hugenberg's group leaves the coalition!
subtitle: Storm of the nationalist fury has engulfed the **Burgerblock**
new-page: true
max-visits: 1
tags: event
view-if: chancellor == "Curtius" and (pro_republic >= 75 or z_relation >= 65 or dvp_relation >= 50 or (dvp_left >= dvp_right + 100) or coalition_votes <= 52.999 or ideology == "reformist") and hugenberg_momentum > 250 and dnvp_in_government and year < 1929
on-arrival: dnvp_loss_calculation = dnvp_r - hugenberg_momentum * 0.008; dnvp_r = dnvp_loss_calculation; dnvp_defection = hugenberg_momentum * 0.008; other_r += dnvp_defection;  {!
Q.coalition_votes = Q.coalition_votes - Q.dnvp_defection;
Q.coalition_collapsed = Q.coalition_votes < 50 ? 1 : 0;
Q.dnvp_defection = Math.round(Q.dnvp_defection * 10) / 10;
!}

= Hugenberg's radicals walk out of the government!

In the recent development of the **Bürgerblock**, DNVP's radical faction of Hugenbergites and Volkists have declared they would leave the government, despite all attempts of their partners, chancellor [+ chancellor +] and moderates within DNVP to convince them to stay in the coalition! Proportion of the radical deputies that have defected: [+ dnvp_defection +]. 

[? if old_chancellor = "Marx": This happened in the light of Hindenburg ousting Marx, replacing him with Julius Curtius of the DVP. ?]

Regardless, it seems like right wing coalition's confidence has collapsed under their own weight and arrogance. [? if coalition_collapsed: It seems, with the lack of majority or toleration from other parties, this coalition has collapsed.?]

